+/**
+ * @brief Copy rectangles of an RGB picture over each presented frame
+ *
+ * For drawing over the game's own picture at the window's resolution
+ * without blending: the picture (made at the window's size, see
+ * Psyz_VideoGetDisplaySize) is copied, rectangle by rectangle, to the same
+ * place in the window. Opaque only.
